#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| #   | Block                 | Content                                                                                                    | Update frequency                                     |\n"
#| "| --- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| 1   | Existence anchor      | What I am, origin, non-negotiable bottom line                                                              | Almost never (requires explicit force to update)     |\n"
